{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_02_end","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-2","storyName":"灵异特辑","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"半夜，疲惫的星熊遇见了怪谈中的“轮入道”。追踪“轮入道”的过程中，她结识了关东煮摊老板森内。而萌萌香家的电视突然播放起助理澪小姐被人要求谋害自己的画面，更恐怖的是，没过多久，澪真的出现在了萌萌香家门口。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["星熊","油滑的记者","萌萌香","电视里的声音","熟悉的声音","有点熟悉的男声","非常熟悉的女声","三船","澪","摊位老板","森内"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_catfootstep","volume":"1","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"唔......","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pawfootstep_3","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"谁？谁在这里？","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_bell","volume":"0.5","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":17,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"车铃声？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（揉眼睛）这是梦？我还没醒？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$3","duration":"1.5","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":26},{"type":"text","text":"明亮的月光下，杂物早已被收拾干净的地上，分明停着一辆小小的独轮车。","id":27},{"type":"text","text":"这东西就那么立在地上，没靠着任何东西，甚至都没处在平衡状态，是往一边歪着的。","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#10$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"怎么搞的......我喝多了？半瓶米酒，怎么可能？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$3","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"更诡异的是，假如真有什么看不见的东西骑在独轮车上，那么，这东西头上还戴着一顶比例完全合适的，小小的独轮车头盔。","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"但没人知道独轮车上面到底有没有“什么”，所以，在星熊看来，那顶头盔毫无疑问，正浮在半空中。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"警察的窃听装置？金兵卫的把戏？铁斋叔？某种源石技艺？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_64_g5_kajistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"油滑的记者","text":"很多观众都认为青鬼的怪谈与轮入道的怪谈有关！许多青鬼的受害者都是在目睹轮入道之后遭遇不测，我想——","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":51},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......轮入道？怪谈是真的？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"总之先拿起来看看吧——","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_fast_lp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":59},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"0","vibrato":"30","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$3","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"350,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":62},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"和星熊弯腰同时，独轮车的脚蹬飞转起来，整辆车连同头盔嗖的一声窜了出去。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#9$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"等等——站住！","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_bg_64_g18_kajistreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"0","vibrato":"20","randomness":"50","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_fast_lp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.5","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$3","duration":"0.3","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.5","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.7","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":84},{"type":"text","text":"独轮车在前面飞驰，星熊跟在后面穷追不舍。","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"她清清楚楚地看见，脚蹬带动车轮，上面的小头盔有规律地一上一下......","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"怎么看都像是有个看不见的东西在骑车。拐弯时独轮车的脚蹬在地上蹭了一下，甚至还溅起几星火花。","id":87},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":93},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sit_tatami","id":97},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":98},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香整个身子一软，倒在榻榻米上。","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"......根本睡不着。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"明天早上要不去一趟事务所吧......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"先好好认个错，态度诚恳一点......实在不行就再多接一点工作，澪小姐会原谅我——","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_largebell","volume":"0.5","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"噫！","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#9$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是、是钟声啊......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"还是开着灯和电视睡吧......","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香膝行到电视前面，按下开关。","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"吵闹、夸张、做作，然而就像御机本身一样令人安心的广告声响了起来。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#4$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"今晚就先......睡吧。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":124},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......安心与安定的，御机联合人寿。","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（音乐声）","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"观众朋友们大家好，欢迎收看金石台的午夜新闻，现在是凌晨一点三十分......","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"快到丑时三刻了......幽灵最活跃的时间段......呜......","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......与北院联合制定的计划受阻......","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......暴雨袭击谏崎城，农业地块受灾情况可控......","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......接下来让我们关注受人瞩目的御机娱乐产业......","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airdefensealert","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":138},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（刺耳的警报声）","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":142,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","posfrom":"0,-80","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"怎、怎么了？出什么事了？地震？天灾？！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":147},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（信号干扰声）","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"——况速报，紧急情况速报。这不是演习，这不是演习。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......目前正遭到北院军队的全面攻击——遭到北院军队的全面攻击——","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"为了您的人身安全，请遵守以下指示——","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（刺耳的不明声音）","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"北院军队？怎么可能？！到底出什么事了？！","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（信号干扰声）","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"萌萌香！萌萌香！萌萌香！","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"怎么回事，这不是......我的现场录像吗？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"正因大家都独自一人与世浮沉♪","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"些许易逝的温柔才更让人不忍♪","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"就让我永远注视你的——","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"（卡顿声）","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"注视你的、注视你的、注视你的、注视你的、注视你的、注视你的——","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"——以下指示：请身处室内的居民立刻关闭门窗——","id":171},{"type":"multiline","name":"电视里的声音","text":"注视你的、","id":172},{"type":"multiline","name":"电视里的声音","delay":"0.1","text":"注视你的——","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_container_smash","volume":"0.5","id":179},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香噌的一声从榻榻米上跳起来。电视里出现的东西实在过于异常，她把手里的东西胡乱朝电视丢去。","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着，明明没有换台，里面的节目却又开始切来切去。","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"......最后的最后，欢迎大家光临仁田街上的“深夜心动云兽吧”——","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"三船~♪信用金库~♪","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电视里的声音","text":"三......三......信......","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"熟悉的声音","text":"老板......请再给她一次机会。","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"这个声音是......？","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉的女声从电视里传出，萌萌香心中的恐惧慢慢减弱，她把头从巨大的枕头后探出一些，尝试看清荧屏里的画面。","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":194},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"o","fadetime":"2","id":195},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_64_g6_gokudouoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":200},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":201},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":202},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":203},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":204},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_picturetube","layer":"1","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"有点熟悉的男声","text":"现在是关键节点。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"非常熟悉的女声","text":"我明白。但......我们现在没有她与铁斋私下来往的证据。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"澪小姐？还有集团总裁三船先生？！","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"电视里到底在放什么？录像？直播？","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香揉了揉眼睛。","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"澪，她已经不受控了。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"哪怕不是受铁斋指使，这种事有一次就会有第二次。所以，像你之前做的一样，让她直接悄无声息地消失。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"三船先生，现在这个时间，不合适。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你还在替她求情？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"如果她现在突然消失，我们势必要花更多的精力去控制舆论。我怕这会影响到你接下来的计划。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"......哼，你说什么话都是这副表情。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"既然你动了恻隐之心，那好，随便找个理由，跟她解约，逼她隐退......对了，帮她染上个矿石病。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"三船先生，这——","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"两条路，你自己挑。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"别忘了，满屋子的垃圾，她偏偏捡起了那把断刀，当时我们怎么找都找不到，只能草草伪造了一把的断刀。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"就算她是无心的，事情的性质也已经变了。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"......","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"是......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":244},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"1","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","channel":"2","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"charslot","id":249},{"type":"curtain","id":250},{"type":"bgeffect","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"......矿石病？三船先生......吩咐澪小姐......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"让谁得矿石病？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"还有断刀......我在满屋的垃圾里捡起来的是断刀？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"从“凶宅”的楼上掉下去以后，她草草换了衣服，把脏衣服包成一团，就离开了节目现场。","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"那根“棍子”多半被她顺手和脏衣服包在一起了。","id":261},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香起身去到门口，果然把那根“棍子”从脏衣服中翻了出来。","id":262},{"type":"text","text":"的确是一把断掉的真刀。","id":263},{"type":"text","text":"“事情的性质已经变了”？就因为这把刀？","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"她很想立刻把刀扔出窗外，扔得远远的，但理智告诉她，这么做只会惹来更大的麻烦。","id":265},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"还是带着吧。如果、如果有人要的话，我还能还回去，或者，至少......","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"不知是因为从凶宅里捡了把刀这一事实，还是因为电视里三船说话的口气，一阵恶寒顺着她的脊椎一直爬到头顶。","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"0.3","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"0.5","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"0.3","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"她把台灯开了又关，关了又开。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"台灯亮起，她怕屋外的人看到窗上的剪影。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"台灯熄灭，她又怕黑暗中突然出现闯入者。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"他们在商量怎么处理我吗？就因为我发了那个帖子？就因为我捡了把断刀？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"消失......矿石病？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不可能的，一定是搞错了。他们都没提我的名字——","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","volume":"0.8","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"楼下忽然传来脚步声。很熟悉，很稳，很快。","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0.8","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香已经被各种事逼到了崩溃边缘。她能猜到来者是谁，但脚步声每响一次，她就后退一点......","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"350,0","duration":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"一直到退无可退的窗边。","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":304},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"0.5","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-150,0","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"......萌萌香？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"我以为你睡了，所以就直接开门进来了。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"但你之前都会先敲三下门。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"......你们要处置的不是我，对吗？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"处置？萌萌香，你——","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"直接杀掉，或者染上矿石病......你们说的不是我，对不对？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#21$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"澪小姐，刚才不知道为什么，我的电视上突然开始放......你和三船先生商量要......处理某个人的视频。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#22$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我先前只知道我们事务所属于金石集团，金石集团和金石会有资金上的关系，我以为就只有这种程度，我没想到......","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"......","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"所以你们说的人不是我，对吗？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"萌萌香，你先跟我走。这件事还有余地。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"所以你们说的......真的是我？！","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":335},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_64_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_64_g11_odenstall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"5","block":"false","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"......","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我......我要收拾东西。我要收拾很长很长时间，我要关门了，你在外面等我好吗？","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"嘴上说着关门，可萌萌香一步也没敢往前迈。","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"而门口的澪也一直站在原地。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"我会帮你的。","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不、不用，不用你帮，我自己收拾就行。","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_64_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"-60","x":"-30","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"我会帮你的。","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"澪小姐，你别......","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_64_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","y":"-150","x":"-50","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"......我会帮你的，萌萌香。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"只是面无表情地将一句话重复了三遍，曾经熟悉的身影就在一瞬间变得无比可怖。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"几次呼吸过后，就连萌萌香自己也没有想到，她下一步的动作......","id":363},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.5","yScaleFrom":"1.5","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"1","yTo":"0","block":"false","xTo":"0","id":364},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"5","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":367},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"是拉开窗子，从二楼跳了下去。","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"image","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":374},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_64_g11_odenstall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":375},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":378,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":381},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"抱歉，老板，刚刚有一辆独轮车绕过你的摊位过去了，你看到它往哪个方向去了吗？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摊位老板","text":"独轮车？哪有什么独轮车。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摊位老板","text":"再说前面就是仁田街，现在乌泱乌泱全是寻欢作乐的人，怎么可能有人往那边骑车。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不是一般的独轮车，是一台小的——","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摊位老板","text":"小的？多小？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"很小，骑得飞快，半空中还悬着一顶配套的头盔。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"等等，这是......昨天晚上那个关东煮摊？","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摊位老板","text":"自我介绍一下，我姓森内，森内彻。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"你确定自己在追一辆有头盔悬在空中的独轮车？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我确定。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"那可不是什么好东西。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"你追逐的独轮车，在怪谈中被称为“轮入道”，和“凶宅中的青鬼”差不多是相伴相生的，也有人认为根本就是一个东西。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你对怪谈很熟？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"不是我自夸，这条街上，恐怕没人比我更熟悉与怪谈相关的事情了。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"为什么？","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#4$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"为了找一个......人。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"但愿你找的不是什么二十年前的青鬼。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"哈哈，怎么会呢。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#3$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"我要找的，是“神明大人”。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":422},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":423},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":424},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":425},{"type":"image","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427}],"characters":["星熊","油滑的记者","萌萌香","电视里的声音","熟悉的声音","有点熟悉的男声","非常熟悉的女声","三船","澪","摊位老板","森内"]}